eenshots need a windowed/display session. Live mode injects a development harness; exports must respect its stripping/self-disable behavior. Other MCP clients are not individually verified here.","limitations","源码提供的内容","Verified Python CLI/MCP implementation under src/gda, daemon IPC, and an actual GDScript runtime harness at src/gda/harness/gda_harness.gd. skills/gda/SKILL.md and docs/gda-skill.md provide agent guidance; documented configuration explicitly covers Claude Code, Codex, and Cursor.","codeScope","代码类型","实现代码","codeType","links","参考资料","items",[86],"evidenceUrl",{"_55":82,"_25":87},"https://github.com/aigengame/godot-agent#register-with-coding-agents","代码与使用说明",[91],"codeUrl",{"_55":88,"_25":92},"https://github.com/aigengame/godot-agent/tree/main/src/gda","主要来源",[96],"sourceUrl",{"_55":93,"_25":97},"https://github.com/aigengame/godot-agent","引擎与运行环境","Godot","engine","list","客户端与模型归属","ordered",false,[107,108,109],"agents","Claude Code","Codex","Cursor","工具类别","引擎桥接","lead","summary","bridge",[117,118,119],"implementation","claude-code","codex","cursor",{"_121":122},"documents",{"_64":123,"_35":124},[126,130,131,132,129,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,128,165,127,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183],[125,126,127,128,129],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","v